      "id": "claim_0865eea3c3224d8eac9d5a008b680488",
      "statement": "A skill is a directory containing a SKILL.md whose name and description remain available to the harness while the detailed body is loaded on demand when the task matches, making skills a progressive-disclosure context mechanism.",
